{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Postman Environment for AI APIs.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Postman Environment for AI APIs.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"postman environment for ai apis postman environment for ai apis","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Postman Environment for AI APIs.md","fileName":"Postman Environment for AI APIs.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Postman Environment for AI APIs","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI-Assisted Network Automation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted Network Automation","Network AI API Request Anatomy","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Postman Environment for AI APIs.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Postman Environment for AI APIs.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"postman environment for ai apis postman environment for ai apis","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Postman Environment for AI APIs.md","fileName":"Postman Environment for AI APIs.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Postman Environment for AI APIs","heading":"Postman Environment for AI APIs","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A Postman environment groups reusable values such as an AI endpoint, model name, and credential variable around a collection of requests. This turns an ad hoc API experiment into a repeatable workspace where headers, payloads, examples, and response tests can be shared.\n\nSecrets should be kept in appropriately protected local or managed values rather than exported with a public collection. Automated tests can check status, schema, or required fields, but network correctness still needs domain validation. The environment is most useful as a bridge between a visible [[Network AI API Request Anatomy]] experiment and production code.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted Network Automation","Network AI API Request Anatomy","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Postman Environment for AI APIs.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Postman Environment for AI APIs.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"postman environment for ai apis postman environment for ai apis","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Postman Environment for AI APIs.md","fileName":"Postman Environment for AI APIs.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Postman Environment for AI APIs","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted Network Automation","Network AI API Request Anatomy","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}